<h3 id="pgepubid00003">
        <span id="chapter_one-s295">(<span id="chapter_one-s295-w0">Supplied</span> <span id="chapter_one-s295-w1">by</span> <span id="chapter_one-s295-w2">a</span> <span id="chapter_one-s295-w3">Late</span> <span id="chapter_one-s295-w4">Consumptive</span> <span id="chapter_one-s295-w5">Usher</span> <span id="chapter_one-s295-w6">to</span> <span id="chapter_one-s295-w7">a</span> <span id="chapter_one-s295-w8">Grammar</span> <span id="chapter_one-s295-w9">School</span>.)</span>
