      <span id="chapter_one-s1418-w13">his</span> <span id="chapter_one-s1418-w14">hands</span>, <span id="chapter_one-s1418-w15">and</span> <span id="chapter_one-s1418-w16">so</span> <span id="chapter_one-s1418-w17">remained</span> <span id="chapter_one-s1418-w18">kneeling</span>, <span id="chapter_one-s1418-w19">till</span> <span id="chapter_one-s1418-w20">all</span> <span id="chapter_one-s1418-w21">the</span> <span id="chapter_one-s1418-w22">people</span> <span id="chapter_one-s1418-w23">had</span> <span id="chapter_one-s1418-w24">departed</span>, <span id="chapter_one-s1418-w25">and</span>
      <span id="chapter_one-s1418-w26">he</span> <span id="chapter_one-s1418-w27">was</span> <span id="chapter_one-s1418-w28">left</span> <span id="chapter_one-s1418-w29">alone</span> <span id="chapter_one-s1418-w30">in</span> <span id="chapter_one-s1418-w31">the</span> <span id="chapter_one-s1418-w32">place</span>.</span>
